# A bare pattern only matches at the top of the context, so these need the
# leading **/ to catch frontend/node_modules (426M), frontend/vite-tmp (113M)
# and the dangling test/e2e/node_modules symlink. Without it they all ship to
# the builder, and `COPY frontend` overwrites the node_modules that
# `yarn install` just produced in the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
deploy/*.yaml
backend/static
